# i18n text sources

Do not add strings to random files. Use the correct source:

| What | Edit |
|------|------|
| Viewer buttons, help modal, search | `public/locales/{ja,en}/common.json` |
| Home sections, About HTML body | `src/libs/constants/staticData.js` (`ja` / `en` objects) |
| Site-wide SEO defaults | `src/libs/constants/dataSiteMeta.js` |
| Per-page title / meta description | Page file + `Meta` component |

## Rules

- Always update **both** `ja` and `en`
- Prefer `next-i18next` `t("key")` for new viewer UI; use `staticData` only for long HTML blocks
- First mention of terms: 詞書（絵巻の説明文） style gloss — see `site-pages-plan.md`
- Avoid contradicting About mission: emaki are **unrolled and followed**, not "read" like a book
